        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Por fin Eitri puso hierro en el fuego. La mosca picó a Brokkr en el párpado, y por un momento no pudo ver.",
          "en": "At last Eitri laid iron in the fire. The fly stung Brokkr on the eyelid, and for a moment he could not see."
        },
        {
          "es": "Brokkr soltó el fuelle para espantar a la mosca, apenas un instante.",
          "en": "Brokkr let go of the bellows to swat the fly, only for an instant."
        },
        {
          "es": "Eitri sacó del fuego un martillo: Mjolnir. Era perfecto, salvo que el mango quedó un poco corto.",
          "en": "Eitri drew a hammer from the fire: Mjolnir. It was perfect, except that the handle came out a little short."
        },
        {
          "es": "Por eso el martillo de Thor tiene el mango corto: por ese instante sin aire.",
          "en": "That is why Thor's hammer has a short handle: that one instant without wind."
        },
        {
          "es": "Eitri le dio los tesoros a su hermano y le dijo: llévalos a Asgard y cobra la apuesta.",
          "en": "Eitri handed the treasures to his brother and said: take them to Asgard, and collect the bet."
        }
      ],
